{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Seaweed is an item that can be caught using a ",["l","工具","Fishing Pole"]," in the ocean during all ",["l","季节","seasons"],", including a 41% chance to catch Seaweed while fishing in the deep-sea ",["l","夜市","submarine"]," ride at the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"],". It is never caught in ",["l","蟹笼","Crab Pot"],"s."]],["p",["It can also be foraged from a narrow strip of shore by the ",["l","沙滩","Tide Pools"],", i.e., to the east of the wooden footbridge, but it spawns relatively infrequently (3% chance per night). The saltwater ",["l","鱼","crab pot fish"]," (",["l","鸟蛤","Cockle"],", ",["l","螃蟹","Crab"],", ",["l","龙虾","Lobster"],", ",["l","蚌","Mussel"],", ",["l","牡蛎","Oyster"],", and ",["l","虾","Shrimp"],") may produce 1-3 Seaweed in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," when the population of the pond is at least 1. It's also possible to find Seaweed in ",["l","矿井","the \"Dangerous Mines\""]," on floors 1-29 when the ",["l","矿井","Shrine of Challenge"]," is turned on. Seaweed can also randomly be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s."]],["p",["Catching Seaweed with a Fishing Pole always gives 3 ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing"]," XP, and picking up from the beach gives 7 ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," XP. Seaweed, either fished or foraged, is always normal quality."]],["p",["Seaweed is displayed in the ",["l","收集品","Fish section"]," of the ",["l","收集品","collection"]," tab, and counts towards the four fishing ",["l","钓鱼","Achievements"],". However, it is otherwise not considered to be a fish, and therefore cannot be sold to ",["l","威利","Willy"]," at the ",["l","鱼店","Fish Shop"],", does not benefit from fish price bonuses, cannot be used in place of \"Any Fish\" in ",["l","烹饪","recipes"],", and cannot be put in a ",["l","鱼饵制造机","Bait Maker"],", ",["l","熏鱼机","Fish Smoker"],", or ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"."]],["p",["One Seaweed can be placed in any ",["l","鱼缸","Fish Tank"]," as decoration, including the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],"'s fish tank after the ",["l","收集包","fish tank bundle"]," is completed. Its appearance in player-placed fish tanks can be changed by picking up and re-placing the fish tank."]]]],["Map",2,[["p",["Seaweed can be found in the ocean and on the beach."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Seaweed is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","生鱼寿司","Maki Roll"]],["Fish and rice wrapped in seaweed."],["Any ",["l","鱼","Fish"]," (1)",["i","(O)152","Seaweed ×1"],["i","(O)423","Rice ×1"]],["Energy 100\nHealth 45"],["The Queen of Sauce (21 Summer, Year 1)\n ",["l","星之果实酒吧","Stardrop Saloon"]," for 300g"],["220g"]]]]]],["Buildings",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Cost"]},{"h":1,"v":["Size"]}],[[["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]],["Raise fish and harvest their produce. Fish multiply over time."],["5,000g",["i","(O)390","Stone ×200"],["i","(O)152","Seaweed ×5"],["i","(O)153","Green Algae ×5"]],["5x5"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Seaweed is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Kelp Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a green dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Seaweed may be randomly requested during any season at the ",["l","任务","\"Help Wanted\" board"]," outside ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"]," for a reward of 60g and 150 ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," points."]],[1,["1-2 Seaweed may be requested by several ocean fish in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 3 to 5."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",["* ",["l","工具","Fishing Pole"],": Ocean\n* ",["l","采集","Foraging"],": ",["l","沙滩","The Beach"],"\n* ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s\n* ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"\n* ",["l","矿井","The \"Dangerous Mines\""]]],["Season",["All"]],["Sell Price",["20g"]]]}